Subject: fix(deck): Use super + 1/2 for Overlay/QAM

Replaces the patch for CTRL + 1/2 for Overlay/QAM with Super + 1/2 and
allows for CTRL for a smooth transition.

Suggested-by: Antheas Kapenekakis <git@antheas.dev>
---
